[ 45.374] CM360_DS218> help fdt
[ 45.377] fdt - flattened device tree utility commands
[ 45.377] 
[ 45.379] Usage:
[ 45.385] fdt addr [-c]  <addr> [<length>]   - Set the [control] fdt location to <addr>
[ 45.394] fdt move   <fdt> <newaddr> <length> - Copy the fdt to <addr> and make it active
[ 45.400] fdt resize                          - Resize fdt to size + padding to 4k addr
[ 45.405] fdt print  <path> [<prop>]          - Recursive print starting at <path>
[ 45.414] fdt list   <path> [<prop>]          - Print one level starting at <path>
[ 45.419] fdt get value <var> <path> <prop>   - Get <property> and store in <var>
[ 45.425] fdt get name <var> <path> <index>   - Get name of node <index> and store in <var>
[ 45.434] fdt get addr <var> <path> <prop>    - Get start address of <property> and store in <var>
[ 45.442] fdt get size <var> <path> [<prop>]  - Get size of [<property>] or num nodes and store in <var>
[ 45.448] fdt set    <path> <prop> [<val>]    - Set <property> [to <val>]
[ 45.456] fdt mknode <path> <node>            - Create a new node after <path>
[ 45.462] fdt rm     <path> [<prop>]          - Delete the node or <property>
[ 45.468] fdt header                          - Display header info
[ 45.470] fdt bootcpu <id>                    - Set boot cpuid
[ 45.476] fdt memory <addr> <size>            - Add/Update memory node
[ 45.482] fdt rsvmem print                    - Show current mem reserves
[ 45.487] fdt rsvmem add <addr> <size>        - Add a mem reserve
[ 45.493] fdt rsvmem delete <index>           - Delete a mem reserves
[ 45.499] fdt chosen [<start> <end>]          - Add/update the /chosen branch in the tree
[ 45.508]                                         <start>/<end> - initrd start/end addr
[ 45.513] NOTE: Dereference aliases by omiting the leading '/', e.g. fdt print ethernet0.
